1
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:29,780
Kwang Soo.

2
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,140
Yes, sir!

3
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:37,430
Why do all the people that I love leave me like this?

4
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:15,410
For you

5
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:18,330
I must have been a bad guy.

6
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:26,810
Ji Hee! Don't forgive me.

7
00:01:27,990 --> 00:01:36,970
What should I do? I don't want to lose her.

8
00:03:00,060 --> 00:03:02,260
What should I do?

9
00:03:04,410 --> 00:03:10,390
That's okay. That's okay.

10
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:13,720
I'm sorry.

11
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:20,840
Don't say sorry again.

12
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:23,560
I'll not let you go.

13
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:30,450
I can lose everthing but you.

14
00:03:30,450 --> 00:03:37,320
Don't think about anything else. Just stay with me.

15
00:04:26,910 --> 00:04:28,850
I have to go now.

16
00:04:28,850 --> 00:04:33,750
I need to meet someone.

17
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:46,450
You just stay here.

18
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:53,050
Don't go anywhere.

19
00:04:53,050 --> 00:04:57,250
I'm not ordering you. I'm asking you.

20
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:14,530
That's good.

21
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:20,890
I'm shameless, aren't I?

22
00:05:20,890 --> 00:05:22,600
You can't control

23
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:27,490
who you fall in love with.

24
00:05:27,490 --> 00:05:30,760
Let's go inside.

25
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:40,580
Min Hyuk!

26
00:05:40,580 --> 00:05:42,590
Your father is tired.

27
00:05:42,590 --> 00:05:46,050
If you do this.

28
00:06:04,180 --> 00:06:07,260
Just forgive me this once.

29
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:09,470
I won't marry Se Yeon.

30
00:06:09,470 --> 00:06:11,360
How can you do this under such a circumstance?

31
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,610
I know you've treated me well,

32
00:06:13,610 --> 00:06:15,150
but for all these years,

33
00:06:15,150 --> 00:06:17,810
I never had anything I really wanted.

34
00:06:17,810 --> 00:06:19,380
If you're not going to marry Se Yeon

35
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:21,250
and take over this company, then get out.

36
00:06:21,250 --> 00:06:25,450
I want to protect that girl.

37
00:06:25,450 --> 00:06:31,330
I don't want to hear about it. Get out!

38
00:06:31,330 --> 00:06:38,270
I'll take care of what I am in charge of now.

39
00:06:49,190 --> 00:06:54,170
Are you really going to let him go?

40
00:06:54,170 --> 00:07:01,110
Don't worry. He'll come back.

41
00:07:01,110 --> 00:07:03,380
He's my son.

42
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:06,570
I know him better than anyone.

43
00:07:06,570 --> 00:07:11,340
He's different this time.

44
00:07:11,340 --> 00:07:17,830
Go investigate the girl throughly.

45
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:19,810
Yes, sir!

46
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:14,990
How did it go?

47
00:08:14,990 --> 00:08:16,230
Like Ms. Kang said,

48
00:08:16,230 --> 00:08:22,420
she almost hit a truck on the night of the accident.

49
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,810
Why didn't the driver say anything to the police?

50
00:08:24,810 --> 00:08:26,130
What about the drum?

51
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:27,880
His truck was overloaded,

52
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:30,030
so he didn't want to get in trouble.

53
00:08:30,030 --> 00:08:31,530
Any evidence?

54
00:08:31,530 --> 00:08:35,620
He doesn't have a black box,

55
00:08:35,620 --> 00:08:40,980
and because it was raining that day, he couldn't recognize the driver.

56
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:51,770
Did he tell anyone

57
00:08:51,770 --> 00:08:54,210
about that accident?

58
00:08:54,210 --> 00:08:55,510
I don't think so.

59
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:59,590
When I asked him about it, he remembered.

60
00:08:59,590 --> 00:09:02,360
See him again.

61
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:04,520
If there isn't an evidence then make one.

62
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:06,840
You remember that?

63
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,660
But...

64
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:09,970
I know the truth.

65
00:09:09,970 --> 00:09:13,800
Ahn Do Hoon was driving that day.

66
00:09:25,110 --> 00:09:27,830
I don't know if I should do this.

67
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:30,880
Thank you.

68
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:36,350
I hope this will help you. I have to go.

69
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:52,120
On the day my father disappeared. Where did you go?

70
00:10:53,690 --> 00:10:56,680
- Get off! - What were you thinking about while driving?

71
00:10:57,110 --> 00:11:01,080
Thinking about where you can dump my father?

72
00:11:05,820 --> 00:11:07,150
Get off!

73
00:11:19,130 --> 00:11:21,000
What might this be?

74
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:40,330
- What are you doing? - What am I doing?

75
00:11:40,330 --> 00:11:43,610
You don't know it as a lawyer?

76
00:11:46,210 --> 00:11:51,610
What? When you dumped my father,

77
00:11:51,610 --> 00:11:54,560
you didn't think this would happen?

78
00:11:55,330 --> 00:11:58,420
You said I was dragging you down.

79
00:11:59,330 --> 00:12:06,850
No! What you did yourself is dragging you down.

80
00:12:06,850 --> 00:12:09,560
I went to see President Jo.

81
00:12:18,180 --> 00:12:20,100
These are files about you.

82
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:25,470
Two pages. They didn't care about your hard working days.

83
00:12:25,470 --> 00:12:28,800
Your education, asset, family relations,

84
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:31,260
and your record as an ex-convict.

85
00:12:31,260 --> 00:12:34,090
That's what they want to know about you.

86
00:12:34,090 --> 00:12:36,810
Do you want to date with Jo Min Hyuk?

87
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:43,150
- That's none of your business. - Are you trying to make drag him down just like you did to me?

88
00:12:43,850 --> 00:12:48,620
If Min Hyuk chooses you, he'll lose everything.

89
00:12:49,370 --> 00:12:51,810
- If that happens, I'll be glad. - Shut up!

90
00:12:51,810 --> 00:12:56,350
Pull yourself together, you know what your problem is?

91
00:12:56,350 --> 00:13:01,920
Because of that damn love, you can't even see your own future clearly.

92
00:13:44,330 --> 00:13:48,620
I'm glad you're here. I wanted to see you.

93
00:14:04,290 --> 00:14:09,090
Who do you think people will side with between you and me?

94
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:12,610
Don't think who he likes

95
00:14:12,610 --> 00:14:16,320
is more important than other people's thought?

96
00:14:18,910 --> 00:14:21,120
You seem very confident.

97
00:14:21,430 --> 00:14:25,880
This marriage won't make either of you happy.

98
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:30,280
Don't you think you are the one who cause it?

99
00:14:31,050 --> 00:14:34,020
Stop using Min Hyuk.

100
00:14:36,110 --> 00:14:40,420
You can't use other man to keep the man who left you.

101
00:14:40,420 --> 00:14:44,460
Do you regret breaking up with Do Hoon?

102
00:14:44,460 --> 00:14:46,220
Is that why you don't want to leave?

103
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:48,280
I don't regret breaking up with him.

104
00:14:49,490 --> 00:14:53,860
I wish I had let him go earlier.

105
00:14:54,560 --> 00:15:01,300
I knew he didn't love me, but I was foolish to keep him.

106
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:09,790
Trying to keep someone who doesn't love you is imposition, not love.

107
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:22,980
How dare you!

108
00:15:25,890 --> 00:15:29,790
Since you slapped me, I'll say one more thing.

109
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:35,110
You're going to marry soon,

110
00:15:35,110 --> 00:15:40,150
but you don't look happy.

111
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:39,360
Have you been waiting long?

112
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:41,200
It's what I do well.

113
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:43,380
You didn't know when I'd come.

114
00:16:43,380 --> 00:16:45,550
You should've called me.

115
00:16:45,550 --> 00:16:48,560
You're lonely without me following you around?

116
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:53,670
Did something happen?

117
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:56,100
I couldn't reach you all day.

118
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:58,680
Nothing happened.

119
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:04,620
What about you?

120
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:12,330
Something happened, but I forgot about it as soon as I saw you.

121
00:17:20,130 --> 00:17:23,680
You're not dressed warmly enough. I want to walk a little bit longer.

122
00:17:26,260 --> 00:17:30,050
- You'll get cold. - I'm not cold.

123
00:17:32,450 --> 00:17:36,220
I worked at a ski resort in winter,

124
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:40,520
and I'm used to cold weather. This is a piece of cake.

125
00:17:42,710 --> 00:17:45,100
Is there anything you haven't done?

126
00:18:32,910 --> 00:18:35,420
It's too sweet for me.

127
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:39,130
It'll warm you up.

128
00:18:54,010 --> 00:18:57,770
I'm not going to marry her.

129
00:19:01,370 --> 00:19:03,380
Why don't you say anything?

130
00:19:06,460 --> 00:19:12,900
It's because of you. So you can't run away from me.

131
00:19:20,360 --> 00:19:28,130
Thank you and I'm sorry.

132
00:19:28,130 --> 00:19:33,700
You shouldn't thank me. I should thank you.

133
00:19:44,650 --> 00:19:47,730
Well...

134
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:53,690
Other couples will do that...

135
00:19:53,690 --> 00:19:58,380
Lean on my shoulder.

136
00:20:49,900 --> 00:20:53,430
You live alone on an island all by yourself.

137
00:20:53,430 --> 00:20:56,210
All of a sudden, three girls appear.

138
00:20:56,210 --> 00:20:59,830
No. 1, she's pretty but she's idealistic.

139
00:20:59,830 --> 00:21:03,140
No. 2, she's soft inside, but tough outside.

140
00:21:03,140 --> 00:21:05,920
All of a sudden.

141
00:21:06,780 --> 00:21:09,410
Oops!

142
00:21:09,450 --> 00:21:13,300
Who is she? She is very sexy with a bright smile.

143
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:15,220
She's the third girl.

144
00:21:15,220 --> 00:21:17,390
Look at me! Look at me!

145
00:21:17,390 --> 00:21:20,080
One, two, three! Go!

146
00:21:20,520 --> 00:21:24,980
You're a wise man. Who would you choose among these three?

147
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:26,600
Sandra! What are you doing?

148
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:28,690
There aren't three girls here. I'm the only girl here.

149
00:21:28,690 --> 00:21:30,390
You two are too old for him.

150
00:21:30,390 --> 00:21:32,680
Hey! We're not that old.

151
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:34,350
Older women are still women.

152
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:36,960
Can you be young forever?

153
00:21:37,410 --> 00:21:40,080
You guys are drinking again.

154
00:21:42,690 --> 00:21:44,770
What are you doing here?

155
00:21:44,910 --> 00:21:47,560
It's way past his working hours. Don't be so strict

156
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:50,780
He doesn't work for you 24 hours a day.

157
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:53,000
Sir,

158
00:21:53,260 --> 00:21:54,940
you've become more handsome.

159
00:21:54,940 --> 00:21:56,470
By the way, it's really late at night,

160
00:21:56,470 --> 00:22:01,000
so can I ask what you did with Yoo Jung and where you took her?

161
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:04,050
Are you a detective? It's none of your business.

162
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:08,380
Why do you come back so early?

163
00:22:10,170 --> 00:22:11,550
You only have these snacks?

164
00:22:11,550 --> 00:22:13,130
I'll go make some more.

165
00:22:13,130 --> 00:22:14,470
Why you?

166
00:22:14,470 --> 00:22:15,520
Sit here.

167
00:22:15,520 --> 00:22:18,460
Madam, why don't you go make some?

168
00:22:18,460 --> 00:22:19,900
Hey!

169
00:22:19,900 --> 00:22:21,600
I look older because of my hair style,

170
00:22:21,600 --> 00:22:25,110
If I straghiten my hair up, I'll look as young as her.

171
00:22:25,310 --> 00:22:28,480
Kwang Soo, what is she talking about?

172
00:22:28,480 --> 00:22:31,550
I think she'd be prettier with straight hair.

173
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:35,470
Sit!

174
00:22:35,620 --> 00:22:40,420
Oh my god. You have a weird taste.

175
00:22:40,420 --> 00:22:41,910
Unbelievable!

176
00:22:41,910 --> 00:22:44,820
I understand. Don't say anything.

177
00:22:44,820 --> 00:22:47,400
Calm down. Come on.

178
00:22:52,110 --> 00:22:54,230
Check the liabilities for me.

179
00:22:56,520 --> 00:22:58,570
I'll call you back.

180
00:23:02,740 --> 00:23:04,060
Se Yeon.

181
00:23:04,060 --> 00:23:07,080
President Jo seems worse than I thought.

182
00:23:07,080 --> 00:23:09,550
The operation went well.

183
00:23:09,550 --> 00:23:12,000
We're waiting for the result.

184
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:17,510
I told you that no one knew Min Hyuk better than me.

185
00:23:17,510 --> 00:23:19,910
No matter how crazy he is about her,

186
00:23:19,910 --> 00:23:24,880
he can't abandon his family.

187
00:23:25,940 --> 00:23:28,510
Shake up the K Corporation.

188
00:23:29,310 --> 00:23:33,800
If his father falls, he'll come back.

189
00:23:36,610 --> 00:23:41,270
It might take longer than you think.

190
00:23:41,270 --> 00:23:43,920
I'm not that stupid, sir.

191
00:23:44,100 --> 00:23:47,730
I've made a plan.

192
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:11,140
I'll talk to Min Hyuk.

193
00:24:24,890 --> 00:24:27,140
I've heard what you said.

194
00:24:27,370 --> 00:24:29,440
What did my father say?

195
00:24:31,520 --> 00:24:33,440
He's not well enough.

196
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:36,380
He needs to rest for a while.

197
00:24:36,470 --> 00:24:40,610
We're telling the press that he's busy checking into the resort business.

198
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,820
While I'm in jail,

199
00:24:42,820 --> 00:24:45,070
if you don't take of of the company,

200
00:24:45,070 --> 00:24:47,550
then it'll be hard to develop.

201
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:50,030
We knew this would happen.

202
00:24:50,030 --> 00:24:54,020
But we're messed up because we aren't fully prepared.

203
00:24:55,130 --> 00:24:57,710
You need to be in charge.

204
00:24:57,740 --> 00:25:02,130
Gwang Min, I already told you.

205
00:25:02,290 --> 00:25:05,590
I'm not going to change my mind...

206
00:25:05,590 --> 00:25:07,600
This is the key to the safe deposit box.

207
00:25:07,600 --> 00:25:09,960
You keep it while I'm in jail.

208
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:10,750
Gwang Min!

209
00:25:10,750 --> 00:25:13,520
Whether you like it or not,

210
00:25:13,520 --> 00:25:16,510
you're the heir to the K Corporation.

211
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:39,090
The file you wanted about Ahn Do Hoon

212
00:25:39,090 --> 00:25:41,260
is in the safe deposit box.

213
00:25:41,470 --> 00:25:44,640
Although he helped us a lot,

214
00:25:44,640 --> 00:25:47,640
but he knows too much about us.

215
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:49,940
We don't know when he might betray us.

216
00:25:49,940 --> 00:25:52,670
When he becomes a threat to us,

217
00:25:52,670 --> 00:25:55,260
the files might help you.

218
00:26:24,010 --> 00:26:25,690
Sir!

219
00:26:26,230 --> 00:26:28,880
You think I didn't see you.

220
00:26:33,040 --> 00:26:34,750
Smile.

221
00:26:45,450 --> 00:26:47,450
Smile for me.

222
00:26:50,430 --> 00:26:53,070
I'll go after I see your smile.

223
00:27:17,750 --> 00:27:19,050
I have to go.

224
00:28:14,910 --> 00:28:18,990
Se Yeon! Se Yeon!

225
00:28:23,210 --> 00:28:27,290
You come to me only when you need me.

226
00:28:34,090 --> 00:28:36,660
Why did you do that?

227
00:28:39,010 --> 00:28:40,910
So what?

228
00:28:41,090 --> 00:28:44,870
This isn't enough to destroy the K Corportaion,

229
00:28:44,870 --> 00:28:47,870
but Se Gwang and Shina aren't going to let this good opportunity slide.

230
00:28:47,870 --> 00:28:49,600
What are you planning now?

231
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:53,240
You must be aware of

232
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:56,150
what I am planning.

233
00:28:56,560 --> 00:29:00,710
I won't give up what I have,

234
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:03,790
If you want to keep your company,

235
00:29:03,790 --> 00:29:05,170
side with me.

236
00:29:05,170 --> 00:29:07,230
What are you talking about?

237
00:29:07,550 --> 00:29:09,710
If I lose my company,

238
00:29:09,710 --> 00:29:13,570
your father will be the first one to against our marriage.

239
00:29:14,450 --> 00:29:17,770
Isn't that what you want?

240
00:29:19,260 --> 00:29:24,400
What I want is you.

241
00:29:24,460 --> 00:29:27,130
You! It's you!

242
00:29:29,590 --> 00:29:31,570
Don't tell me that you didn't know.

243
00:29:31,570 --> 00:29:33,210
When you were down because of your mother,

244
00:29:33,210 --> 00:29:34,570
when your father kicked you out,

245
00:29:34,570 --> 00:29:37,170
when Seo Ji Hee died,

246
00:29:37,170 --> 00:29:39,940
It was me who sided with you.

247
00:29:49,130 --> 00:29:50,900
Se Yeon.

248
00:29:53,900 --> 00:29:55,620
I love you.

249
00:29:57,520 --> 00:30:01,810
I love you. I love you. I said I love you.

250
00:30:14,320 --> 00:30:16,060
I'm sorry.

251
00:30:19,790 --> 00:30:21,770
I'm sorry.

252
00:30:24,350 --> 00:30:26,440
You and that girl,

253
00:30:26,710 --> 00:30:29,720
do you think you'll have a good ending?

254
00:30:33,140 --> 00:30:38,790
You asked me how love that started from revenge would end.

255
00:30:43,670 --> 00:30:49,070
I'll show you how it ends.

256
00:31:22,730 --> 00:31:24,560
Here are some more peppers.

257
00:31:24,560 --> 00:31:25,340
Thank you.

258
00:31:25,340 --> 00:31:26,570
Okay.

259
00:31:26,570 --> 00:31:28,900
Welcome.

260
00:31:35,700 --> 00:31:37,340
Can I have a bowl of soup?

261
00:31:37,340 --> 00:31:40,230
We're closing soon. Just leave.

262
00:31:41,550 --> 00:31:44,810
People are still eating.

263
00:31:45,210 --> 00:31:47,420
Just give me one.

264
00:32:02,970 --> 00:32:05,490
She's a customer. What're you doing?

265
00:32:05,490 --> 00:32:07,980
Go take her some.

266
00:32:17,580 --> 00:32:20,060
Where do you think you are?

267
00:32:22,120 --> 00:32:23,850
You're early.

268
00:32:23,850 --> 00:32:25,650
Do you want some too?

269
00:32:25,650 --> 00:32:27,920
Let's talk after we eat.

270
00:32:27,930 --> 00:32:33,070
You even asked Do Hoon to come here.

271
00:32:33,070 --> 00:32:35,610
What do you want?

272
00:32:35,710 --> 00:32:37,480
Are you trying to ruin our business?

273
00:32:37,480 --> 00:32:39,720
Mother. Don't worry.

274
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:40,820
Get out.

275
00:32:40,820 --> 00:32:41,990
Let's go outside and talk.

276
00:32:41,990 --> 00:32:43,560
Why?

277
00:32:43,620 --> 00:32:45,680
Why can't we talk here?

278
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:48,400
Okay. Let's talk here.

279
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:51,760
Now, he's found a girl, and his life is getting better.

280
00:32:51,760 --> 00:32:53,680
Why on earth are you here?

281
00:32:53,680 --> 00:32:54,770
A girl?

282
00:32:54,770 --> 00:32:58,290
Yes, she is a kind girl.

283
00:32:58,290 --> 00:33:00,280
She's a painter,

284
00:33:00,280 --> 00:33:03,180
and she's nothing like you.

285
00:33:03,180 --> 00:33:04,550
Please stop.

286
00:33:04,550 --> 00:33:06,500
Shin Se Yeon.

287
00:33:06,500 --> 00:33:10,030
You think they are well matched.

288
00:33:12,260 --> 00:33:13,870
Do you think her parents will approve of that?

289
00:33:13,870 --> 00:33:15,470
Go outsie with me.

290
00:33:15,930 --> 00:33:17,680
Now.

291
00:33:20,040 --> 00:33:22,280
Do Hoon!

292
00:33:22,560 --> 00:33:24,010
Stop!

293
00:33:24,640 --> 00:33:25,370
What?

294
00:33:25,370 --> 00:33:27,920
How dare she think that Do Hoon isn't good enough?

295
00:33:27,920 --> 00:33:30,520
Let them talk themeselves.

296
00:33:30,520 --> 00:33:31,890
They were deeply in love.

297
00:33:31,890 --> 00:33:33,380
In love?

298
00:33:33,380 --> 00:33:35,680
Stop thinking about that.

299
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:37,350
They had a kid.

300
00:33:37,350 --> 00:33:40,440
You can't just make that go away.

301
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:45,370
Don't give her a reason to cling to him.

302
00:34:04,070 --> 00:34:06,190
It's useless for you to do this.

303
00:34:06,190 --> 00:34:10,480
The evidence that you have won't prove anything.

304
00:34:11,740 --> 00:34:13,310
Is that so?

305
00:34:13,900 --> 00:34:18,740
Should I go to the press, then?

306
00:34:21,140 --> 00:34:24,080
You like to be on TV.

307
00:34:24,080 --> 00:34:27,240
No matter what you do, it won't work.

308
00:34:27,240 --> 00:34:29,870
How can I stop you?

309
00:34:29,870 --> 00:34:33,370
Should I destroy Jo Min Hyuk completely?

310
00:34:33,370 --> 00:34:37,540
You can never destroy him that easily.

311
00:34:37,740 --> 00:34:42,500
At least, I can see his true heart.

312
00:34:42,500 --> 00:34:44,200
True heart?

313
00:34:51,220 --> 00:34:54,000
You're still living in a dream.

314
00:34:55,050 --> 00:34:56,870
Do you still believe in stuff like that?

315
00:34:56,870 --> 00:34:58,440
I do.

316
00:34:58,440 --> 00:35:01,230
I take pity on you who doesn't believe it.

317
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:04,420
How poor you are.

318
00:35:13,630 --> 00:35:16,560
This won't end here.

319
00:35:16,680 --> 00:35:19,870
I'll bring you to court, no matter what it takes.

320
00:35:20,060 --> 00:35:23,380
In the place you worshiped so much,

321
00:35:24,110 --> 00:35:28,020
you'll have to confess to your crime.

322
00:35:41,530 --> 00:35:42,390
Have you heard that?

323
00:35:42,420 --> 00:35:45,260
President Jo's legal advisor has been arrested.

324
00:35:45,700 --> 00:35:47,420
Our company might go bankrupt.

325
00:35:47,460 --> 00:35:48,900
I saw the newspaper article.

326
00:35:48,930 --> 00:35:50,400
It's serious.

327
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:51,680
What should I do?

328
00:35:51,720 --> 00:35:53,150
Did you see it?

329
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:54,550
What's going to happen to us?

330
00:35:54,590 --> 00:35:56,250
I don't know.

331
00:35:56,660 --> 00:35:57,660
- Yoo Jung. - Yes.

332
00:35:58,200 --> 00:36:01,210
They said our restaurant is going to be sold,

333
00:36:01,240 --> 00:36:02,530
is that true?

334
00:36:05,340 --> 00:36:06,520
Kang Yoo Jung.

335
00:36:06,560 --> 00:36:08,650
You seem quite close to Mr. Jo.

336
00:36:08,690 --> 00:36:10,600
Have you heard anything from him?

337
00:36:14,160 --> 00:36:16,580
We received the investment,

338
00:36:16,610 --> 00:36:20,240
and the customers speak highly of our menu.

339
00:36:20,490 --> 00:36:21,800
We'll be okay.

340
00:36:22,070 --> 00:36:23,660
You don't know anything.

341
00:36:23,700 --> 00:36:25,280
Our restaurant is doing fine.

342
00:36:25,310 --> 00:36:27,520
It's headquarters that's in trouble.

343
00:36:27,950 --> 00:36:30,540
They'll sell the restaurant chain first.

344
00:36:30,580 --> 00:36:32,620
We'll have a new owner?

345
00:36:32,860 --> 00:36:35,070
What if they fire all of us?

346
00:36:35,450 --> 00:36:36,890
I'm finished this time.

347
00:36:36,930 --> 00:36:38,220
If I don't pay my rent again,

348
00:36:38,250 --> 00:36:40,000
Ja Yeong will kill me.

349
00:36:40,460 --> 00:36:42,850
- I bought a new purse last month. - I'm not feeling well.

350
00:36:43,740 --> 00:36:44,940
Somone sent this file to the board.

351
00:36:44,970 --> 00:36:46,790
I knew it would be you.

352
00:36:46,830 --> 00:36:49,200
It was too obvious and was no fun.

353
00:36:49,890 --> 00:36:52,030
I just told them the truth.

354
00:36:52,060 --> 00:36:53,350
I didn't do anything good.

355
00:36:53,380 --> 00:36:55,050
I'm not going to talk about this.

356
00:36:55,410 --> 00:36:57,220
Get Attorney Choi Gwang Min

357
00:36:57,250 --> 00:36:58,530
out of jail!

358
00:36:58,560 --> 00:36:59,760
I will try.

359
00:36:59,790 --> 00:37:01,900
You'll have to.

360
00:37:02,610 --> 00:37:06,110
He has some files about you.

361
00:37:06,390 --> 00:37:07,860
Who knows?

362
00:37:08,130 --> 00:37:10,200
If you prove that you're useful to our company,

363
00:37:10,230 --> 00:37:11,990
even if you were arrested for a hit-and-run,

364
00:37:12,020 --> 00:37:14,730
Gwang Min might get you released.

365
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:20,170
And this.

366
00:37:24,910 --> 00:37:26,990
Listen to it when you have time.

367
00:37:27,780 --> 00:37:29,540
It's the testimony of the truck driver.

368
00:37:29,570 --> 00:37:31,270
You'll enjoy it.

369
00:37:32,120 --> 00:37:33,250
It'll refresh your memory

370
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:39,450
of what you have down before.

371
00:38:20,580 --> 00:38:23,250
It's more difficult that I thought.

372
00:38:24,290 --> 00:38:27,380
The painting you gave to the Director of the NTS,

373
00:38:27,380 --> 00:38:30,040
was purchased by the Shina Foundation.

374
00:38:30,530 --> 00:38:32,980
If they investigate it thoroughly,

375
00:38:33,270 --> 00:38:36,200
it might be diffcult to stop it.

376
00:38:36,450 --> 00:38:37,250
So?

377
00:38:37,280 --> 00:38:39,160
This is your chance.

378
00:38:39,590 --> 00:38:41,630
I'll get you out.

379
00:38:42,100 --> 00:38:43,750
Are you going to give up your life

380
00:38:43,780 --> 00:38:47,890
for President Jo and his son?

381
00:38:47,930 --> 00:38:51,780
I don't think you're genuinely concerned about me.

382
00:38:52,350 --> 00:38:54,520
What is it that you want?

383
00:38:55,660 --> 00:38:58,840
I heard you have files about me.

384
00:39:00,820 --> 00:39:07,510
I loved martial arts novels.

385
00:39:08,340 --> 00:39:11,340
But the story is always the same.

386
00:39:11,790 --> 00:39:15,140
The right-hand man always betrays the boss.

387
00:39:15,170 --> 00:39:18,830
Give the files to me.

388
00:39:18,870 --> 00:39:21,850
You are similiar to me.

389
00:39:22,890 --> 00:39:25,150
We were born with nothing,

390
00:39:25,180 --> 00:39:29,200
but are quiet smart. That's why we're here.

391
00:39:32,660 --> 00:39:34,930
Do you know the difference between us?

392
00:39:34,970 --> 00:39:36,230
This is your last chance.

393
00:39:36,270 --> 00:39:40,920
I don't betray people over something that doesn't belong to me.

394
00:39:41,320 --> 00:39:44,180
Isn't it too obvious?

395
00:39:44,520 --> 00:39:47,610
We've seen it in books and in real life too many times.

396
00:39:47,740 --> 00:39:49,280
Gwang Min!

397
00:39:53,400 --> 00:39:56,240
I really want to be this kind of guy,

398
00:39:57,070 --> 00:39:59,670
who protects what he should protect,

399
00:39:59,710 --> 00:40:04,910
instead of saving himself.

400
00:40:06,130 --> 00:40:11,360
In real life, not in books.

401
00:40:30,500 --> 00:40:31,580
Jae Ha!

402
00:40:35,930 --> 00:40:38,780
How clumsy of you

403
00:40:39,890 --> 00:40:42,340
to take pictures like this?

404
00:40:50,340 --> 00:40:51,720
It's your brother,

405
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:53,710
- who took them. - What?

406
00:40:53,740 --> 00:40:58,970
Your brother wnats to buy the shares of Se Gwang Heavy Industry.

407
00:40:59,060 --> 00:41:01,170
While you're trying to destroy our company,

408
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:04,290
your brother has been making the shares that you have useless.

409
00:41:04,320 --> 00:41:06,240
Why are you telling me this?

410
00:41:06,270 --> 00:41:09,760
I know we don't like each other.

411
00:41:10,220 --> 00:41:13,130
When I see you, I want to quarrel with you.

412
00:41:13,460 --> 00:41:16,190
You and I are both awful people,

413
00:41:16,900 --> 00:41:21,400
but we should stop acting like dogs.

414
00:41:22,630 --> 00:41:26,030
Did you spread rumors about my father?

415
00:41:27,370 --> 00:41:29,000
What's your point?

416
00:41:29,030 --> 00:41:30,630
Okay.

417
00:41:31,350 --> 00:41:33,670
I'll put these down.

418
00:41:33,700 --> 00:41:35,710
I think your brother and

419
00:41:35,750 --> 00:41:37,770
the Shina Hotel are up to something.

420
00:41:38,510 --> 00:41:41,380
I like you better than your brother.

421
00:41:41,650 --> 00:41:43,170
What do you want from me?

422
00:41:43,810 --> 00:41:48,250
Call me when you want to have a drink.

423
00:41:50,620 --> 00:41:55,030
Do you think I will not buy the restaurant as along as you did it?

424
00:41:55,610 --> 00:42:00,330
This is why you don't have a friend, you idiot!

425
00:42:28,290 --> 00:42:29,680
Have a seat.

426
00:42:30,030 --> 00:42:32,260
I have something to tell you.

427
00:42:43,870 --> 00:42:47,690
We can skip the usual greetings.

428
00:42:49,280 --> 00:42:54,120
Min Hyuk is not going to marry Se Yeon because of you.

429
00:42:54,920 --> 00:42:57,360
Did you hear what happened to our company?

430
00:42:58,400 --> 00:43:02,670
Gwang Min is like an old brother to Min Hyuk.

431
00:43:02,710 --> 00:43:05,830
He's sacrificing himself for the company to protect Min Hyuk.

432
00:43:05,870 --> 00:43:07,940
What do you think Min Hyuk will feel at the moment?

433
00:43:07,970 --> 00:43:08,980
I'm sorry.

434
00:43:09,010 --> 00:43:11,320
If you're sorry, leave.

435
00:43:12,860 --> 00:43:17,850
Do you want to destroy the company his father has built?

436
00:43:18,250 --> 00:43:22,200
I made a promise.

437
00:43:23,800 --> 00:43:26,850
I'll not leave,

438
00:43:27,650 --> 00:43:30,660
until he tells me to leave.

439
00:43:32,510 --> 00:43:34,870
Don't you understand what I'm talking about?

440
00:43:34,900 --> 00:43:36,640
I'm sorry.

441
00:43:37,550 --> 00:43:40,370
I have a way of making you understand.

442
00:43:41,630 --> 00:43:43,250
I'll see you later.

443
00:43:54,770 --> 00:43:55,940
Do it tomorrow,

444
00:43:55,980 --> 00:43:57,500
why do you have to do it now?

445
00:43:57,530 --> 00:44:00,690
I'll become lazy if I leave it tomorrow.

446
00:44:01,260 --> 00:44:02,340
I'm done.

447
00:44:02,370 --> 00:44:03,630
Aren't you tired?

448
00:44:04,320 --> 00:44:05,550
No.

449
00:44:18,310 --> 00:44:22,150
Are you guys going to be okay?

450
00:44:22,150 --> 00:44:29,010
Ja Yeong. I don't deserve to be happy, do I?

451
00:44:29,400 --> 00:44:32,700
I thought one day was enough,

452
00:44:33,310 --> 00:44:35,590
but I want him more.

453
00:44:35,590 --> 00:44:41,310
You've been sufferd a lot, you can be happy now.

454
00:44:42,160 --> 00:44:45,300
It's okay, if I hadn't gone to jail,

455
00:44:45,300 --> 00:44:47,780
I wouldn't have met you guys.

456
00:44:50,050 --> 00:44:52,370
And Min Hyuk.

457
00:44:52,370 --> 00:44:55,590
It's enough as long as you're happy now.

458
00:44:55,590 --> 00:44:57,240
Let's go to sleep.

459
00:45:08,630 --> 00:45:11,790
This will hurt the Shina Foundation as well.

460
00:45:11,790 --> 00:45:13,480
Do you know that?

461
00:45:13,480 --> 00:45:15,320
I know.

462
00:45:16,290 --> 00:45:20,050
This will hurt not only the K Corporation, but you as well.

463
00:45:20,050 --> 00:45:21,110
I can't do that.

464
00:45:21,110 --> 00:45:22,230
Do as I say.

465
00:45:22,230 --> 00:45:25,170
Why are you doing this?

466
00:45:26,390 --> 00:45:30,780
I want to see Min Hyuk kneel in front of me and beg for my mercy.

467
00:45:30,780 --> 00:45:33,520
But, you'll get hurt first.

468
00:45:42,740 --> 00:45:46,600
Do what I want you to do.

469
00:45:55,070 --> 00:45:58,510
I can't.

470
00:45:58,510 --> 00:46:03,910
I'll make Min Hyuk kneel in front of you and beg for your mercy.

471
00:46:07,440 --> 00:46:11,520
I like your loyalty.

472
00:46:12,850 --> 00:46:15,080
So...

473
00:46:15,980 --> 00:46:20,180
When I am completely alone,

474
00:46:21,460 --> 00:46:23,990
will you hold me in arms?

475
00:46:24,460 --> 00:46:26,520
I will.

476
00:46:46,520 --> 00:46:48,670
You're pretty.

477
00:46:49,820 --> 00:46:52,260
You're prettier when you smile.

478
00:46:57,140 --> 00:47:04,170
I'm afraid I'll fall asleep before you come, so I drank a lot of sweet coffee.

479
00:47:40,870 --> 00:47:43,770
I feel good now.

480
00:47:45,830 --> 00:47:47,740
Yoo Jung.

481
00:47:48,470 --> 00:47:50,250
Yes.

482
00:47:50,250 --> 00:47:55,820
Don't die before me.

483
00:47:58,910 --> 00:48:01,120
I won't.

484
00:48:32,030 --> 00:48:36,020
Father, what are you doing here so late?

485
00:48:37,410 --> 00:48:40,270
What is this, Do Hoon?

486
00:48:42,760 --> 00:48:46,990
Tell me this isn't true, and it wasn't you.

487
00:48:46,990 --> 00:48:51,910
Father. Don't worry about it.

488
00:48:51,910 --> 00:48:58,720
How can I not? What is it?

489
00:48:59,430 --> 00:49:05,410
It says that you dumped Yoo Jung's father. What is this all about?

490
00:49:05,410 --> 00:49:11,040
Yoo Jung is doing this because she can't accept the fact that we broke up.

491
00:49:11,040 --> 00:49:12,150
It's not a big deal.

492
00:49:12,150 --> 00:49:14,130
How can you say that?

493
00:49:14,130 --> 00:49:16,050
You saw her at the restaurant.

494
00:49:16,050 --> 00:49:19,670
She's changed. She's crazy.

495
00:49:22,920 --> 00:49:28,480
Do Hoon... Are you really my son?

496
00:49:30,110 --> 00:49:33,740
I have a meeting. You should go.

497
00:49:35,680 --> 00:49:40,860
I need to see Yoo Jung.

498
00:49:41,410 --> 00:49:44,180
I'll figure it out.

499
00:49:44,180 --> 00:49:45,110
If she's mad at us,

500
00:49:45,110 --> 00:49:49,760
we need to apologize and beg for gorgiveness.

501
00:49:49,760 --> 00:49:51,970
What are you talking about?

502
00:49:52,500 --> 00:49:57,370
You've lived all your life as if you had done something wrong.

503
00:49:59,280 --> 00:50:06,390
I don't want to live like you. Don't go to see Yoo Jung.

504
00:50:06,390 --> 00:50:08,810
I'll take care of it.

505
00:50:10,160 --> 00:50:12,510
You should go now.

506
00:50:40,060 --> 00:50:46,620
Isn't it enough to get Min Hyuk involved? You even went to see my father?

507
00:50:47,110 --> 00:50:48,640
What should I do to stop you?

508
00:50:48,640 --> 00:50:55,110
I don't want to stop yet. You're still up there, safe and sound.

509
00:50:56,140 --> 00:51:01,180
What happened to your father was an accident.

510
00:51:01,180 --> 00:51:08,580
Choose the right word. It wasn't an accident, it was a murder.

511
00:51:08,580 --> 00:51:10,810
There isn't enough evidence.

512
00:51:10,810 --> 00:51:14,570
If I can't bring you to court, I'll go to the press.

513
00:51:14,570 --> 00:51:16,960
If the press can't spread it,

514
00:51:16,960 --> 00:51:21,080
I'll follow you everywhere until I destroy you.

515
00:51:45,140 --> 00:51:47,320
I'm sorry.

516
00:51:48,180 --> 00:51:50,660
That's easy.

517
00:51:51,640 --> 00:51:53,700
I'm sorry, Yoo Jung!

518
00:51:55,610 --> 00:52:01,150
I'll see you in court tomorrow. You know the place well.

519
00:52:02,420 --> 00:52:04,010
You know how to get there.

520
00:52:04,010 --> 00:52:09,620
I told you. It was an accident. It wasn't my fault.

521
00:52:09,620 --> 00:52:12,290
You always said it wasn't your fault.

522
00:52:12,290 --> 00:52:16,730
Your parents, me and rich people are to be blame.

523
00:52:17,690 --> 00:52:23,270
Nobody else but you put you in this position.

524
00:52:23,900 --> 00:52:27,200
Don't blame others.

525
00:52:33,200 --> 00:52:35,140
What are you doing here?

526
00:52:35,140 --> 00:52:38,830
I smell something stinky.

527
00:52:46,130 --> 00:52:49,800
Leaving so soon? Why don't you stay?

528
00:52:49,800 --> 00:52:52,360
Your friend is coming.

529
00:52:53,670 --> 00:52:58,630
Hye Jin. Lee Hye Jin.

530
00:53:00,110 --> 00:53:06,300
You wrote her a letter of recommendation. I thought you two were close.

531
00:53:41,350 --> 00:53:43,230
Se Yeon!

532
00:54:10,430 --> 00:54:12,790
Do Hoon!

533
00:54:15,780 --> 00:54:17,980
I can't...

534
00:54:19,680 --> 00:54:23,260
I can't let it end here.

535
00:54:38,440 --> 00:54:44,170
Are you here to see my father? He's busy with the resort development.

536
00:54:44,170 --> 00:54:47,230
Is he sick again?

537
00:54:47,230 --> 00:54:48,570
Why are you here?

538
00:54:48,570 --> 00:54:51,270
I hope he gets better before our wedding.

539
00:54:51,270 --> 00:54:53,610
Why are you doing this to me?

540
00:54:53,610 --> 00:54:57,840
You don't know? I want to help your company,

541
00:54:57,840 --> 00:54:59,400
which is in crisis.

542
00:54:59,400 --> 00:55:03,200
I don't need your help. I'll talk to your father.

543
00:55:03,200 --> 00:55:05,300
No.

544
00:55:09,480 --> 00:55:15,580
Yes, you're right. Thank you for having been there for me,

545
00:55:15,580 --> 00:55:19,270
but I can't marry you.

546
00:55:19,270 --> 00:55:23,020
I don't want to feel guilty about you and Yoo Jung for the rest of my life.

547
00:55:23,020 --> 00:55:28,640
What should we do? I want you to be with me.

548
00:55:28,640 --> 00:55:32,890
I want you live a miserable life.

549
00:55:32,890 --> 00:55:33,560
Se Yeon.

550
00:55:33,560 --> 00:55:37,830
Don't try to call me that gentle. It's not you.

551
00:55:38,900 --> 00:55:42,350
Do you talk to her in a sweet voice like that?

552
00:56:21,530 --> 00:56:27,280
What? Are you scared?

553
00:56:28,160 --> 00:56:32,410
Why does Mr. Ahn come here?

554
00:56:42,390 --> 00:56:46,040
The painting bribe of Shina Gallery that Mr. Choi was engaged in.

555
00:56:46,040 --> 00:56:50,290
If I reveal those who were involved, it'll cause a big stir.

556
00:56:50,290 --> 00:56:55,300
But don't worry. I can stop it.

557
00:56:55,300 --> 00:56:57,330
What are you doing?

558
00:56:57,330 --> 00:56:59,950
This company that your father has built

559
00:56:59,950 --> 00:57:02,370
might collapse.

560
00:57:02,370 --> 00:57:05,890
Your loyal dog, Choi Gwang Min.

561
00:57:05,890 --> 00:57:10,920
He might have to be jailed for 10 years instead of a few months.

562
00:57:10,920 --> 00:57:15,790
This puts you in danger as well.

563
00:57:16,250 --> 00:57:23,260
K Corporation lost 2.5 billion KRW investing money in the painting.

564
00:57:23,260 --> 00:57:26,600
The procuratorate will think that you embezzled that money to create slush funds.

565
00:57:26,600 --> 00:57:28,900
Give the phone to Min Hyuk.

566
00:57:28,900 --> 00:57:31,760
Listen to me.

567
00:57:31,760 --> 00:57:38,090
I'm the most qualified person to defend you.

568
00:57:46,690 --> 00:57:50,250
I'm the one who can protect Mr. Jo.

569
00:57:50,770 --> 00:57:54,640
The lawyer from the Legal Team of the K Corporation.

570
00:57:54,640 --> 00:57:57,370
Ahn Do Hoon.

571
00:57:58,200 --> 00:58:01,020
What are you going to do?

572
00:58:07,160 --> 00:58:09,840
What are you doing here?

573
00:58:12,410 --> 00:58:16,930
Both you and I are in danger.

574
00:58:16,930 --> 00:58:23,600
Choose between living together, or dying together.

575
00:58:23,600 --> 00:58:25,950
Shin Se Yeon!
